{"speciesId":555,"names":{"fr":"Darumacho","es":"Darmanitan","en":"Darmanitan","ja":"ヒヒダルマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il entretient des flammes à 1 400 °C dans son corps. De quoi détruire un camion-benne d’un coup de poing!"},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its internal fire burns at 2,500° F, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"S’il a le dessous au combat, il se fige comme un rocher, fait le vide dans son esprit et combat avec sa force mentale."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When weakened in battle, it transforms into a stone statue. Then it sharpens its mind and fights on mentally."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"S’il est blessé dans un combat, il se fige comme un rocher, fait le vide dans son esprit et aiguise ses sens."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando resulta gravemente herido, se endurece como una piedra y medita para agudizar la mente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"激しい 戦いで 傷つくと 岩のように 固まり 黙考して 心を 研ぎ澄ませるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il entretient des flammes à 1 400 °C dans son corps. De quoi détruire un camion-benne d’un coup de poing !"},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Genera llamas que alcanzan los 1400 °C con las que es capaz de destrozar un camión."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck 